                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align=center><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">——社团风采展示暨社团活动周闭幕演出圆满结束</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt"><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> <o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">学生社团作为丰富校园文化，培养学生综合素质的重要载体，已渐渐成为校园文化生活中重要的组成部分。在社团活动周之际，为了展现社团成员的活动成果，团委社团部积极组织各社团准备风采展示，并以演出的形式让全校同学在轻松愉快的氛围中了解我们学校的学生社团。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">4</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">月</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">23</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">日下午第四节课，社团活动周闭幕演出在同学们的热烈期盼中缓缓拉开帷幕。开场表演器乐合奏《采茶灯》由音乐社胡佳琳、卢博文、沈嘉毅、孙思远、何奕韬等音乐社社员为我们带来，《采茶灯》的音乐源于劳动人民采茶活动，表现人们上山采茶过程中欢乐的心情及与茶园、花蝶等大自然和谐相处的情景。这支器乐合奏虽然声部之间还不够均衡和谐，但是我们仍然能感受到他们对民乐的喜爱和执着。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">整场演出最值得一提的是话剧社金弘毅、谢一心、李珂威、傅纹琦等同学为大家带来的话剧《屈原》。为了最大限度展现屈原这个人物的忠义，话剧社自主创编了剧本；为了增强话剧的可看性，演员与编剧几易剧本；为了加强舞台效果，社长金笛同学带领社员们忙前忙后准备服装道具和配音……功夫不负有心人，话剧《屈原》夺得了观看表演的同学们的阵阵掌声。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">整场演出最令人期待的是音乐社邢冠洲、王宇行带来的街舞。邢冠洲同学已经是一中同学们心中的大明星了，几乎每次文艺表演我们都能欣赏到他炫酷的舞技。虽然这只街舞被安排在了整场演出的最后，但仍然有许多同学一如既往地支持他和他的同伴们带来的精彩表演。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">另外，辩论社和话剧社奉献的《舌战群儒》将历史安放于现代，幽默轻松；朗诵社奉献的诗朗诵《黎明的通知》倾诉了民族的苦难，歌颂了祖国的战斗，气势壮阔；合唱社带来的《多情的土地》唱出了对祖国的深深眷恋，深厚婉转；采一社、绿色联盟、银杏文学社、英语沙龙专门拍摄了</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">VCR</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">，同样展现了他们的风采。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">这是一个激荡青春的舞台，也是同学们展现风采和魅力的舞台，所有观看演出的同学和老师们都为之赞叹。应广大学生的要求，社团汇报演出将在期中考试之后加演一场。</SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt" align=center><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201004/2010042907301810.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" height=400 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201004/2010042907301810.jpg" width=600 onload=resizepic(this) border=0></A></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt" align=center><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"></SPAN> </P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt" align=center><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201004/2010042907302941.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" height=400 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201004/2010042907302941.jpg" width=600 onload=resizepic(this) border=0></A></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt" align=center><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"></SPAN> </P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt" align=center><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201004/2010042907304048.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" height=400 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201004/2010042907304048.jpg" width=600 onload=resizepic(this) border=0></A></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt" align=center><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"></SPAN> </P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt" align=center><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201004/2010042907305009.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" height=400 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201004/2010042907305009.jpg" width=600 onload=resizepic(this) border=0></A></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt" align=center><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"></SPAN> </P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt" align=center><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" height=400 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201004/2010042907310076.jpg" width=600 onload=resizepic(this) border=0></SPAN></P>
    
